{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/515e5fd8ca6bb4cc9fa2fe57e6dd22e2.poster.avif?t=1761580137\" width=630 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/515e5fd8ca6bb4cc9fa2fe57e6dd22e2.webm?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/515e5fd8ca6bb4cc9fa2fe57e6dd22e2.mp4?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a detective working for the police. Your current mission: locate a massive, <strong>abandoned facility</strong> hidden deep within a Russian forest. According to scattered reports, the place was used for highly suspicious activities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach the depths, you'll descend countless floors sometimes by<strong> rusted elevator</strong>. The facility is vast, spanning numerous levels. Each level is completely different and hides its own challenges, surprises and dangerous entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know what awaits in the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you will \u2014 soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/84f08c8bdf0dde06a3b7b58a4b9f9af5.poster.avif?t=1761580137\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/84f08c8bdf0dde06a3b7b58a4b9f9af5.webm?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/84f08c8bdf0dde06a3b7b58a4b9f9af5.mp4?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/0e9a797fd5fa2c92a655f5af8980ddca.poster.avif?t=1761580137\" width=630 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/0e9a797fd5fa2c92a655f5af8980ddca.webm?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/0e9a797fd5fa2c92a655f5af8980ddca.mp4?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are equipped with a flashlight, a\u00a0<strong>photo camera</strong> and a high-tech objective-finding device known as <strong>S.E.R.A</strong> (<strong>Spectral Emission Recognition Apparatus)</strong> \u2014 capable of detecting nearby objects with fingerprints or fresh blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task: <strong>find the fragment</strong>\u00a0required to continue your descent to the next floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/23f0bc9c53cbc4942b68800f5a1b944a.poster.avif?t=1761580137\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/23f0bc9c53cbc4942b68800f5a1b944a.webm?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/23f0bc9c53cbc4942b68800f5a1b944a.mp4?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/be999223b010354fbf9d07f92f8aa51d.poster.avif?t=1761580137\" width=630 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/be999223b010354fbf9d07f92f8aa51d.webm?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/be999223b010354fbf9d07f92f8aa51d.mp4?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your descent, you\u2019ll need to solve <strong>puzzles</strong>, uncover new <strong>challenges</strong>. There are secrets scattered along the way. Every level may bring you closer to the truth \u2014 or further into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you reach the bottom you\u2019ll know everything...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>must</strong> do this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/bf72d579258c40a3eadf36af7b203951.poster.avif?t=1761580137\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/bf72d579258c40a3eadf36af7b203951.webm?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/bf72d579258c40a3eadf36af7b203951.mp4?t=1761580137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3481510?t=1761580137","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/3b67335073b086f24958ad11c8f2aefe5a6434ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761580137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets